  <Properties>
    <metaDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[In this post we walk you through the main points of the recent flurry of Umbraco updates and what they mean for Umbraco users in 2026.]]></Value>
    </metaDescription>
    <metaTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Umbraco update: Umbraco 17 released, a new enterprise offering and more]]></Value>
    </metaTitle>
    <openGraphImage>
      <Value><![CDATA[]]></Value>
    </openGraphImage>
    <pageContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a58b29f0-29c6-47b8-b8ce-329b38fbed3c",
      "key": "4d5e6f7a-8b9c-1d2e-3f4a-5b6c7d8e9f0a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003E1. Umbraco 17 released with a focus on stability\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe have already covered on the blog about how Umbraco 17 is a major release, being a long-term supported (LTS) version. It has also seen a new release approach with a new \u201CBeta\u201D phase. However, the final release is now here.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003E2. Enhancements to Umbraco Cloud\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe new release of Umbraco 17 also brings a number of welcome changes and enhancements to the Umbraco Cloud offering. The big news is that Umbraco 17 is available within Umbraco Cloud from day one.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003E3. Changes to Umbraco add-ons\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe release also brings enhancements to the various Umbraco \u201Cadd-ons\u201D such as Umbraco Engage and Umbraco Commerce.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003E4. New Umbraco for Enterprise offering\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA major trend for Umbraco \u2013 reflected in releases like 17 \u2013 is the ability to better serve enterprise customers and give them confidence that Umbraco provides the long-term focus, the feature set and the scalability to support complex, large enterprise projects.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "47b7548d-92f8-4a3d-a632-0b495b62b3ff",
